/// JobResult — what a worker answers for a Job.
///
/// Carries the node that did the work, so the coordinator can prove where a
/// job ran (and that it was reassigned after a node died).
///
/// ## Examples
/// ```beamtalk
/// (JobResult jobId: 1 value: 49 node: #'w@localhost') value   // => 49
/// ```
Value subclass: JobResult
  field: jobId :: Integer = 0
  field: value :: Integer = 0
  field: node :: Symbol = #unknown
